nvertible and \n\n$$\n\\overset{^}{\\beta }=({X}^{T}\\,X)^{-1}{X}^{T}y.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given values of $({X}^{T}X)^{-1}$ and ${X}^{T}y$ into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{^}{\\beta } & =({X}^{T}\\,X)^{-1}{X}^{T}\\,y \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{20}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}24 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7.5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $y=7.5+3x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072172/state.json" "file_sha256" "178b1c4f54b97cf4addaffb005093c6266a1c9f7f70b216319fd251bf98de661"} {"question" "q-139643" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072172/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5f74970c3a9a716993b385dca1338550ee4ceaf5a597501c2da37526adcbc773"} {"question" "q-139643" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072172/state.json" "file_sha256" "178b1c4f54b97cf4addaffb005093c6266a1c9f7f70b216319fd251bf98de661"} {"question" "q-139643" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "y=-3+7.5x"] ["math" "y=3+7.5x"] ["math" "y=3-7.5x"] ["math" "y=7.5+3x"] ["math" "y=7.5-3x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072172/state.json" "file_sha256" "178b1c4f54b97cf4addaffb005093c6266a1c9f7f70b216319fd251bf98de661"} {"question" "q-139643" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "y=7.5+3x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/questi